  "duration": 167.2533125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.16,
      "text": "Imagine you are a scribe in the 1450s."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.52,
      "end": 6.12,
      "text": "All day, you hand copy the king's proclamations"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.12,
      "end": 7.96,
      "text": "and send them out across the kingdom."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.4,
      "end": 10.4,
      "text": "It is a reliable, steady job."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.4,
      "end": 15.24,
      "text": "Then one morning, you hear that a guy in mines built a new machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.76,
      "end": 19.46,
      "text": "It prints pages a thousand times faster than you can write them by hand."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.1,
      "end": 20.98,
      "text": "You have two choices."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.52,
      "end": 23.72,
      "text": "You can pretend the new technology isn't happening,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.1,
      "end": 26.62,
      "text": "or you can learn the machine well enough to operate it."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.3,
      "end": 29.88,
      "text": "This board illustrates our modern version of that story."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.78,
      "end": 32.16,
      "text": "AI is the press in this comparison,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.68,
      "end": 34.66,
      "text": "and learning to use it is today's version"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.66,
      "end": 36.36,
      "text": "of learning to run that new machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.22,
      "end": 38.68,
      "text": "Run it, or someone else will."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.72,
      "end": 40.84,
      "text": "You can start now."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.54,
      "end": 44.1,
      "text": "Learn what AI does well, notice where it struggles,"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.4,
      "end": 46.46,
      "text": "and practice using it for something you care about."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.12,
      "end": 48.64,
      "text": "Every project gives you experience"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.64,
      "end": 49.78,
      "text": "you can bring to the next one."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.44,
      "end": 52.4,
      "text": "We have seen tools close the gap"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.4,
      "end": 54.4,
      "text": "between ideas and creation before,"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.88,
      "end": 56.1,
      "text": "before personal computers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.1,
      "end": 59.38,
      "text": "becoming a designer meant spending years at a drafting table,"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.74,
      "end": 61.44,
      "text": "learning to draw every line by hand."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.14,
      "end": 63.76,
      "text": "Then, desktop publishing arrived."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.46,
      "end": 66.36,
      "text": "Suddenly, a teenager with a personal computer"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.36,
      "end": 68.14,
      "text": "could design posters, magazines,"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.42,
      "end": 69.72,
      "text": "and brochures from their bedroom."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.32,
      "end": 71.68,
      "text": "The tool didn't replace skill."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.2,
      "end": 73.58,
      "text": "Instead, it shortened the distance"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.58,
      "end": 76.54,
      "text": "between wanting to do the work and actually doing it."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.02,
      "end": 79.44,
      "text": "AI gives you a similar chance to start making things"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.44,
      "end": 80.46,
      "text": "while you build your skills."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.08,
      "end": 83.78,
      "text": "This infographic maps out three specific reasons"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.78,
      "end": 85.62,
      "text": "why you'll thrive in the AI future."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.62,
      "end": 87.1,
      "text": "If you begin learning now."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.9,
      "end": 89.22,
      "text": "First, this is your time."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.02,
      "end": 91.78,
      "text": "Building skills while you are in school"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.78,
      "end": 94.14,
      "text": "provides a safe environment to try new things,"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.46,
      "end": 96.4,
      "text": "ask questions, and learn from the results."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.26,
      "end": 98.6,
      "text": "Second, you'll move faster."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.28,
      "end": 102.2,
      "text": "AI helps you try out ideas, get immediate feedback,"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.48,
      "end": 105.06,
      "text": "and tackle projects you otherwise wouldn't know how to start."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.9,
      "end": 108.04,
      "text": "Third, you build good habits early."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.7,
      "end": 111.12,
      "text": "Starting now means you practice asking good questions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.46,
      "end": 114.4,
      "text": "checking answers, and making your own independent decisions."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.04,
      "end": 115.66,
      "text": "Start now."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.14,
      "end": 118.46,
      "text": "Build skills you'll carry into whatever comes next."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.34,
      "end": 121.62,
      "text": "New tools consistently change how people work."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.26,
      "end": 123.34,
      "text": "The steam engine proved this"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.34,
      "end": 125.72,
      "text": "by replacing human and animal physical labor."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.58,
      "end": 127.1,
      "text": "Electricity followed,"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.32,
      "end": 129.8,
      "text": "accelerating factory production and increasing output."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.46,
      "end": 132.52,
      "text": "The internet then shifted how we process"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.52,
      "end": 134.96,
      "text": "and distribute information across a global network."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.78,
      "end": 137.94,
      "text": "AI could do it across almost everything."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.62,
      "end": 140.9,
      "text": "This scale is recognized at the highest levels."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.32,
      "end": 142.26,
      "text": "In July, 2025,"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.26,
      "end": 144.08,
      "text": "the White House released an official"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.08,
      "end": 146.72,
      "text": "national strategy document titled Winning the Race,"
    },
    {
      "start": 147.16,
      "end": 148.62,
      "text": "America's AI Action Plan."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.34,
      "end": 151.88,
      "text": "The document outlines the scope of this technology clearly,"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.44,
      "end": 154.98,
      "text": "an industrial revolution, an information revolution,"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.32,
      "end": 157.16,
      "text": "and a renaissance all at once."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.8,
      "end": 159.4,
      "text": "This is the potential that AI presents."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.16,
      "end": 161.64,
      "text": "AI is today's printing press."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.26,
      "end": 162.84,
      "text": "Learn to run it."
    }
  ],
